            dataHtml: '<table><tr><th>Config</th><th>First Fixation</th><th>Brand Dwell (s)</th><th>Price Dwell (s)</th><th>Gaze Path Complexity</th></tr><tr><td><strong>Shelf A</strong></td><td>Price label</td><td>1.2</td><td>2.8</td><td>Low (linear)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Shelf B</strong></td><td>Brand logo</td><td>2.4</td><td>1.5</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Shelf C</strong></td><td>Hero ingredient</td><td>1.8</td><td>1.1</td><td>High (backtracking)</td></tr></table><br><table><tr><th>UX Variant</th><th>Info Density</th><th>Social Proof</th><th>CTA Fixation %</th><th>Gaze Backtracking</th></tr><tr><td><strong>V-1</strong></td><td>High</td><td>Above fold</td><td>28%</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td><strong>V-2</strong></td><td>Low</td><td>Above fold</td><td>62%</td><td>Low</td></tr><tr><td><strong>V-3</strong></td><td>High</td><td>Below fold</td><td>41%</td><td>Moderate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>V-4</strong></td><td>Low</td><td>Below fold</td><td>55%</td><td>Low</td></tr></table><p style="margin-top:12px;font-size:0.82rem;color:#9999bb;"><strong>Key:</strong> First Fixation = what captures attention first. Dwell = time spent looking. Gaze Path Complexity and Gaze Backtracking = how often the eye doubles back along its path. Eye-tracking shelf study N=52; digital study N=41. Lab conditions may not reflect in-store visual clutter.</p>',
